'''Tho'ra Tech''' is the '''technology brand''' founded and design-led by [[Jono Tho'ra]]. It is not a tech ''tier'' (cyber-tech / psi-tech / star-tech / etc. are tier classifications across the cosmology) and not a tech ''class'' (techno-mage gear, magic-tech instruments, angel-tech are class classifications). Tho'ra Tech is '''a brand''' — recognisable cool technology built to a particular set of themes, aesthetic conventions, and design-language standards that Jono curates personally.

