== Brand vs. Tier vs. Class ==

The canon keeps three independent product-classification axes distinct:

{| class="wikitable"
! Axis !! What it classifies !! Examples
|-
| '''Brand''' || ''Who made it'' and the aesthetic / design-doctrine signature || Tho'ra Tech · third-party Earth-Alliance contractors · [[Viran]] product lines
|-
| '''Tier''' || ''What capability ceiling'' the underlying engineering reaches || Cyber-Tech · Psi-Tech · Star-Tech · Ultra-Tech · Archo-Tech / Magic-Tech / Angel-Tech
|-
| '''Class''' || ''What kind of instrument'' it is || Techno-Mage staff · Magic-Tech wand · Angel-Tech relic · field-engineering multi-tool · psionic device
|}

A Tho'ra Tech-branded product can sit at any tier and any class, as long as it carries the brand's themed look-and-feel and meets Jono's design-doctrine standards. The brand mark is provenance and quality assurance — it does not by itself imply tier-ceiling or class.

== Design Doctrine ==

Tho'ra Tech products carry a recognisable themed look and feel curated by [[Jono Tho'ra]]:

* '''Function-legible silhouettes''' — the form factor reads its function; nothing is ornamental for its own sake.
* '''Tactile interface bias''' — physical controls and haptic feedback are preferred over screen-only UI where the use case permits.
* '''[[Universal Language|UL]]-decorated where appropriate''' — glyph-marking is used where it does real work (warding, addressing, programmer-readable inscription) and is omitted where it would be ornamental.
* '''Combat-dance-compatible ergonomics''' — wearables and hand-tools accommodate [[Combat Dance Style: Harmonic Fusion Flow Martial Arts]] movement vocabulary.
* '''Magneto-gravitic / psi-tech aesthetic palette''' — visible field-emitters, exposed armature where structurally meaningful, materials chosen for psi-tech-compatibility rather than for cosmetic finish alone.

This doctrine is a brand standard, not a tier or class standard. A Cyber-Tech product can carry the Tho'ra Tech mark if it meets the doctrine; a Star-Tech product carries the mark on the same criteria.

